Library: com.livecode.widget.native.searchfield

Type: widget

Summary:
This widget displays a native search field on each supported platform:
  • Mac   – NSSearchField (AppKit)
  • Windows – a subclassed Edit control with magnifying-glass icon
  • Linux   – GtkSearchEntry inside a GtkSearchBar (GTK 3)

Messages sent to the widget's script object:

version: 1.0.0

author: LiveCode

Name: searchTextChanged

Type: widget

Syntax: on searchTextChanged pText

Summary: Sent when the search text changes (on each keystroke).

Parameters: 

pText(string): The current text in the search field.

Name: searchSubmitted

Type: widget

Syntax: on searchSubmitted pText

Summary: Sent when the user submits a search (Return key).

Parameters: 

pText(string): The text submitted.

Name: searchCancelled

Type: widget

Syntax: on searchCancelled

Summary: Sent when the user clears or cancels the search field.


Name: showCancelButton

Type: property

Syntax: set the showCancelButton of <widget> to { true | false }
get the showCancelButton of <widget>

Summary: Whether the cancel / clear button is visible inside the field.




Name: searchText

Type: property

Syntax: set the searchText of <widget> to <pText>
get the searchText of <widget>

Summary: The current text content of the search field.




Name: placeholderText

Type: property

Syntax: set the placeholderText of <widget> to <pText>
get the placeholderText of <widget>

Summary: The placeholder text shown when the search field is empty.




